@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Create product
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KB-001",
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "price": 129.90,
  "stockQuantity": 25
}

### Get products
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=20
